<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dokumente zur Planung, Überwachung und Steuerung von Bauaktivitäten und Sicherheit."@de .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dokumenter, der bruges til at planlægge, overvåge og styre byggeaktiviteter og sikkerhed."@da .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Construction Process & Management Document"@da .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Construction Process & Management Document"@de .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Construction Process & Management Document"@en .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Construction Process & Management Document"@fr .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Construction Process & Management Document"@it .
<https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#ConstructionProcessDocument> <https://dev.qaecy.com/ont#classificationPrompt> "Documents used to plan, monitor, and control construction activities and safety, such as project schedules, change orders, requests for information (RFIs), QA/QC reports, progress reports, and safety records."@en .
# 
# https://dev.qaecy.com/enum#Contract
